  "description": "Vorseta is an elegant serif typeface defined by striking thick-and-thin strokes, graceful curves, and sophisticated letterforms. Its high-contrast design creates a timeless editorial aesthetic, bringing a sense of refinement and visual drama to every composition. From oversized headlines to carefully crafted brand names, Vorseta makes typography the centerpiece of your design.\nPerfect for boutique branding, luxury hotel identities, wedding stationery, floral studios, beauty packaging, fashion editorials, magazine covers, and premium product labels. Its graceful character works beautifully with romantic photography, minimalist layouts, botanical illustrations, and rich color palettes, making it ideal for brands that value elegance and distinctive visual storytelling.\nWhether you’re creating a coastal hotel identity, a floral brand, or a high-end lifestyle campaign, Vorseta brings a polished typographic presence that feels timeless, expressive, and memorable.",
  "fullDescription": "<p>Vorseta is an elegant serif typeface defined by striking thick-and-thin strokes, graceful curves, and sophisticated letterforms. Its high-contrast design creates a timeless editorial aesthetic, bringing a sense of refinement and visual drama to every composition. From oversized headlines to carefully crafted brand names, Vorseta makes typography the centerpiece of your design.</p>\n<p>Perfect for boutique branding, luxury hotel identities, wedding stationery, floral studios, beauty packaging, fashion editorials, magazine covers, and premium product labels. Its graceful character works beautifully with romantic photography, minimalist layouts, botanical illustrations, and rich color palettes, making it ideal for brands that value elegance and distinctive visual storytelling.</p>\n<p>Whether you’re creating a coastal hotel identity, a floral brand, or a high-end lifestyle campaign, Vorseta brings a polished typographic presence that feels timeless, expressive, and memorable.</p>",
